  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 206.07 Oaths or Affirmations. The presiding officer shall administer an oath or affirmation to all individuals who wish to present testimony at any hearing.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7302, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9167, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss by #9223-A, eff 8-1-08",
